  "validationStatus": "Isolated iPhone 16 test verified physical Wi-Fi and cellular binding, packet forwarding, fresh IPv4 HTTPS requests through two authorized node countries, last-intent node selection, and one private-IPv4 DIRECT rule while includeAllNetworks remained enabled. Foreground status overwrite was fixed and retested; two Safari-return connections succeeded but the historical stall was not reproduced. This remains partial route validation: live no-path failure, UDP/QUIC, IPv6, broader protocols, runtime rollback, GeoData redistribution and peak extension memory require validation before a Build 15 release."
